<!-- The whole piece, transcribed from the public-domain Mutopia edition and checked note for note against its MIDI file. No fingering. The four-part texture is kept as the edition writes it: two voices in a hand where it has two lines, with a note both voices share (RH C5 in bar 17, C4 in bar 19; LH D3 in bar 15) written in both. The right hand is in the bass clef from beat 3 of bar 19 to bar 20. Slurred repeated notes (LH bars 22-24) are played again, as the edition slurs rather than ties them. Dynamics, hairpins, "dim.", slurs, accents, the tenuto, the pedal and the cautionary naturals as printed in the Mutopia LilyPond file (01MorningPrayer.ly, piece 2032). -->
